# SpecShot setup (new developers)

If this is a fresh clone, an empty workspace, or the user asks to install / set up / onboard / get the app into Applications:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/specshot-setup/SKILL.md`
2. Install the packaged app with `.cursor/skills/install-to-applications/SKILL.md`
3. Speak the first-run checklist from that setup skill — do not drop them after `npm install`

There is no `.env`. Do not create secrets.
